SUMMARY:Durham Art Walk Holiday Market
DESCRIPTION:The Durham Art Walk Holiday Market is a free two-day indoor and outdoor event with regional artists\, handmade goods\, live music\, and local food. Starting at the Durham Arts Council and spread across multiple venues in downtown Durham\, this easy stroll let’s you explore the best of Durham’s creative arts scene!\nDiscover work by fine artisans and crafters\, watch live performances\, shop unique gifts\, and take in some of Durham’s favorite restaurants and businesses. \nSaturday\, November 21\, 2026\, 10 a.m.–5 p.m.\nSunday\, November 22\, 2026\, 1–5 p.m. \nDowntown Durham\, NC\, at strollable venues throughout the city center. \nFree and open to all ages.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/durham-art-walk-holiday-market/
LOCATION:Durham Arts Council\, 120 Morris Street\, DURHAM\, NC\, NC\, 27701\, United States
CATEGORIES:Art
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Art-Walk-Event-Thumbnail.jpg
