SUMMARY:Rag Alley 2 + Holiday Market
DESCRIPTION:Phelps Phine Art presents\, for DURM’s yearly Holiday Market\,\n“Rag Alley TWO” + open studio\nRag Alley II brings live acoustic locals in the open alley in between\nHolland and Foster Street in the back of Durham Arts Place\nand in front of Phelps Phine Art Studio\nStreet musicians includes: Carisa & Ryan Hartkopf\,\nAndrew Whiteman\, Alex Winshel\, Joseph Hoffheimer\n& MORE! Genres include folk\, bluegrass\, & more! \nThird Saturday\, November Twenty-First\, Twelve to Five post meridiem\nRain or Shine\nEvents are always free & donating to the musicians are appreciated \n(Pictured: Rag Alley ‘25\, King Teen @ kingteenmusic) \nPerformer’s Media:\n@ ryanhartkopf\, @ carisa.cat\, @ andrew_whiteman_music\,\n@ alex_winshel_music\, @ j.hoffheimer \nUncoming\nProcrastinator’s Holiday Market\, 12/18\, 6-9pm\n& onwards\, third fridays 6-9pm \nPhelps Phine Art\n305 East Chapel Hill Street\nDurham\, NC. 27701\n(Back of Block – in the open alley\,\nin between Foster and Holland Street)\ninside the legendary Durham Arts Place (est. ’98) \nwww.julianphelps.com\n@ juliancphelps\nwww.facebook.com/julian.c.phelps
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/rag-alley-2-holiday-market/
LOCATION:Phelps Phine Art\, 305 E Chapel Hill St\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
CATEGORIES:Art,Concert,Exhibit,Kid Friendly
