SUMMARY:Fall Vendor Fair
DESCRIPTION:Join us for our Fall Vendor Fair at Durham Central Park! Shop and support a variety of local businesses and vendors offering unique products\, handmade goods\, delicious food\, sweet treats\, and more. \nJust ahead of the holiday season\, enjoy an afternoon of shopping\, food\, music\, and community with something for everyone! A DJ and 360 photo booth will help bring the fun while you discover and support local vendors. \nCome out\, bring your family and friends\, and enjoy a great day in Downtown Durham!
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/fall-vendor-fair/
LOCATION:Durham Central Park\, 501 Foster St\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
