SUMMARY:Messiah Sing-Along
DESCRIPTION:Sing with us! Just before Thanksgiving\, we will kick off the holiday season with a community sing-along of Handel’s Messiah\, with featured soloists from CSD. You are welcome to bring your own score\, borrow one of ours\, or simply listen. All are welcome!\nIn keeping with our Messiah sing-along tradition\, 100% of donations collected are given to support Open Table Ministry\, a Durham-based 501(c)(3) nonprofit that has served our unhoused neighbors since 2009.\nOpen to the public
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/messiah-sing-along/
LOCATION:Trinity United Methodist Church\, 215 N. Church St\, Durham\, 27701
