SUMMARY:Holiday Tree Lighting
DESCRIPTION:Kick off the holiday season at Downtown Durham’s Annual Tree Lighting! \nJoin your neighbors for an evening of festive cheer featuring live music\, a visit from Santa\, and the lighting of downtown’s holiday tree. \nFree and open to all ages. \nMark your calendars\, November 21\, 4-8 PM.  \nOur DJ/MC for the evening – Pierce Freelon \nMajestic Dollz \nBatala \nTakiri \nBittersweet Brass Band \nTree Ceremony \nMayor Leo & Honored Guests \nPLUS SURPRISES \nCrafts/Activities:\nDPR Letters to Santa\nBook Harvest Free Children’s Books\nThe Blaze Holiday Craft Making\nSanta Stage with Elves\nFace Painting\nMettlesome Theater\nWildly Inclusive German Market\nOrnament Making with Fate & Folklore\nAmerican Tobacco Campus Prizes\nDPAC Giveaways\nDPR Igloo\nAnd more!\n\nEats/Drinks:\nFullsteam Roasted Chestnuts/Gingerbread\nFederal Soup\nMotorco Empanadas\nRose’s Inigiri Truck\nLutra Mini Buns\nParlour Hot Chocolate\nMontwood Cider\n21C Cookies\nSelfHelp Popcorn\nCheeni Chai\nMarriot “Spiked Beverages”\nThe City S’mores\nDosirak\nAshleigh Bakes Cookies\nTreats in the Visitors’ Center\n& More!
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/holiday-tree-lighting/
LOCATION:CCB Plaza\, 201 Corcoran St\, Durham\, 27703
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/tree-lighting-2026_1080x1350.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Downtown Durham%2C Inc.":MAILTO:cheyenne@downtowndurham.com
