SUMMARY:Ponysaurus Wonderland Lighting & Fun Run ✨☃️ 🔥
DESCRIPTION:The lights are back and the beer garden has never been toastier!! Join us for the Ponysaurus Wonderland Lighting and watch the beer garden glow: fire pits\, heaters\, and all 🔥🔥 And for the first time ever\, our patio spaces will be FULLY ENCLOSED\, so you’ll be nice and cozy all season long 😌 \nSip on hot drinks like Spiced Apple Cider\, Sexy Hot Chocolate\, or Gluhwein\, our German mulled wine\, and take the keepsake glass mug home with you! And of course\, we’ll have S’mores Dessert Pizzas\, because no holiday kickoff is complete without a little melted chocolate magic 🍫✨ \nWe’re having a special Wonderland Pony Run at 4:30pm! Join the good people of Fleet Feet for a 1-\, 3- or 5-mile route. Expect a good time and treat yourself to a warm drink for a job well done! The run is free and all levels/speeds are welcome.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/ponysaurus-wonderland-lighting-fun-run-%e2%9c%a8%e2%98%83%ef%b8%8f-%f0%9f%94%a5/
LOCATION:Ponysaurus Brewing Co.\, 219 Hood Street\, Durham\, 27701
CATEGORIES:Brewery,Fitness,Food & Drink,Holiday
