SUMMARY:Tree Lighting Festivities in the Visitor Info Center
DESCRIPTION:Join Discover Durham in the Visitor Info Center (VIC) and celebrate the annual tree lighting in CCB Plaza! \nThe VIC will be passing out Santa hats\, glow sticks\, and pizza from 5pm to 8 p.m.\, while supplies last. Destination Experts will be on-site to help you learn about all the holiday happenings this weekend and throughout the month\, so stop by and celebrate the season!
