SUMMARY:Jazz Social at 21c Durham
DESCRIPTION:Spend your Sunday afternoon surrounded by live music\, contemporary art\, and good company at Jazz Social at 21c Museum Hotel Durham. \nThe NCCU Jazz Collective takes over the Main Gallery for two sets of live jazz\, accompanied by bites from Counting House and specialty cocktails available throughout the afternoon. \nSet within 21c Durham’s contemporary art galleries\, Jazz Social brings together music\, food\, and art for a relaxed Sunday experience in the heart of downtown Durham. \nSunday\, November 22 | 4–6 PM\n21c Museum Hotel Durham — Main Gallery\n$20 per ticket \nTickets are limited. Reserve your spot and spend the afternoon with live jazz\, great food\, drinks\, and contemporary art.
