SUMMARY:heavens to betsy with Pink Flag
DESCRIPTION:Heavens to Betsy is an American punk band formed in Olympia\, Washington in 1991 with vocalist and guitarist Corin Tucker and drummer Tracy Sawyer. The duo were part of the DIY riot grrrl\, punk rock underground\, and were Tucker’s first band before she co-formed Sleater-Kinney.
